tually read  these numbers but the birds she has  over 1200  guides  and the second are plants with  721  wildflowers  so i guess that's representative that  we're talking about birds today and  birds are still number one for the field  guides  there is even  and  there are some guides that you can use  to identify bird poop or road kills  that's only half serious  and if you are going to some of those  places for which guides are not  available there is now a way to download  images for example the  handbook of birds of the world project  out of barcelona spain  lynx editions are promising to make  available to  to subscribers all their digital image  versions of the images that they  generated in producing this series so in  the 16 volumes they managed to  illustrate all 10 000 species of birds  of the world so now you can  easily  use your  ipad or something to generate your own  guide and use it in the field so that's  all i have thank you very much
 

